</ul>
<p><a class="btn_sml" href="grad/index.php#/home">Read more</a></p></div></div><p>We acknowledge and respect the L&#601;k&#787;&#695;&#601;&#331;&#601;n (Songhees and X&#695;seps&#601;m/Esquimalt) Peoples on whose territory the university stands, and the L&#601;k&#787;&#695;&#601;&#331;&#601;n and W&#817;S&#193;NE&#262; Peoples whose historical relationships with the land continue to this day.</p>
